                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum kumeno ubimo poro lembe, man etimo nyithi dhiang’ ario mi mola ma kwar; man ewacu igi kumae, Idho malu Yerusalem tek iwu: nen mungu peri, E Israel, m’ukeli malu kud i ng’om Misiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.28"
            ]
          }
        },
