                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Yeroboam uketho agba i dwi mir aborane, i ceng’ apar wi abije mi dwi, calkud agba ma ni i Yuda, man eidho malu ba pemblam; etimo kumeca i Beth-el, m’ebelamu ko lam ni nyithi dhiang’ m’etimo: man eketho julam mi ka ma malu m’etimo i Beth-el. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
