          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man eidho malu ba pemblam m’etimo i Beth-el i ceng’ apar wi abije mi dwi aborane, en e i dwi m’eporo i adundene gire: man eketho agba ni nyithindho mir Israel, man eidho malu ba pemblamne, kara ewang’ udok ma ng’wice ng’ar.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
